WEBVTT

00:06:59.665 --> 00:07:03.043
Ah, my friends and critics
both kept telling me,

00:07:03.043 --> 00:07:06.589
"Gary, you are a chess player,
you're not a politician.

00:07:07.214 --> 00:07:09.008
This is not chess.

00:07:09.008 --> 00:07:11.260
You see everything in black and white.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:13.095
Politics are gray.

00:07:13.095 --> 00:07:15.389
You have to compromise."

00:07:16.265 --> 00:07:17.391
Really?

00:07:18.434 --> 00:07:22.313
Those who peacefully marched
with me for free Russia

00:07:22.354 --> 00:07:25.316
are either in exile, like me.

00:07:25.316 --> 00:07:27.985
Or in jail, like Alexei Navalny.

00:07:28.027 --> 00:07:31.780
Or even murdered like Boris Nemtsov.